", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_1840524873122821_3055739933188055904_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0aS5yYz9DNYQ7kNvwHaO8ym&_nc_oc=AdrAtnN02-J0cZryl527mEJIf8E8dfZslMLXTZKVNyRijw_i5Ek-bc8WGzReeMywBmg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0wGukZBiT3ldWYE2R1EGKA-Wfe7qTmVgjDLTDx1DdGdA&oe=69F8A179"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3474397939524850", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974494_3474397942858183_7325370313459975246_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SauGx9TQ1g0Q7kNvwHT3ljV&_nc_oc=AdoZH8ZP-5OsLDme8XNugLw0vgYZRkZO6lwvB6AooFyoIppoDFbI3ioWUipUmM4R45s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2e9TSzTEOfGmenfMs_9XccKFHltsdm8Y2NQjIkBJXebw&oe=69F8B84B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hard Drive Logo (6).png", "id": "1060475455596738", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_1060475458930071_8663595066419356644_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=d7RjxiwzT7sQ7kNvwEdBEV9&_nc_oc=AdrqFAP4wsFmpbCVO3kQGRQS5bxchd2krDOKm09HH2UeOlU2pUUm4KeF_m7aJvdaot0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af01KdCDNzd_HLfjVoOjpLdVR85BqKEQZSbTK-SgKIySKQ&oe=69F8B6CE"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# *Hard Drive* \n\nHard Drive is a fast-paced, multiplayer, competitive electro combat driving game. Players control sleek, neon-lit motorcycle looking vehicles, known as bykes, which leave behind a temporary solid trail of light as they move. Players must outmaneuver their opponents by creating a trails of light that they cannot avoid crashing into, while avoiding the trails left by other players.\n\n# _Current Features_\n- Non PvP Driving Park\n- 6 Player Combat Arena\n- Season Pass with Progression Rewards\n- Cosmetic Shop \n\n## More Coming Soon. . .", "short_description": "Electro Combat Driving "}]}, "devel